 *
 * Entries are ordered by priority, then by the insertion number stamped when
 * the entry was pushed, so equal priorities leave in insertion order.
 */

/**
 * Validates a key.
 * @param {unknown} key Candidate key.
 * @returns {string} The key.
 */
